    "$type": "dimension",
    "$description": "Type scale. V2 shifted it down (the user: \"labels and text much smaller\"): UI text 11 px (s), 12 px (m), small text 10 px (xs), the Universe's quietest words 9.5 px (2xs: the callouts, the key and the bottom chips) and an island's name and its sub-line 9 px (3xs, the floor: no word is drawn smaller).",
